<title>CHINA: HK weather - cloudy, heavy showers, max 30 degrees.</title>
<headline>HK weather - cloudy, heavy showers, max 30 degrees.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weather will be cloudy with occasional heavy showers and maximum temperature could reach 30 degrees, the Hong Kong Observatory said on Friday.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m., the temperature was 28 C and relative humidity 83 percent.</p>
<p>Scattered showers were expected on Saturday, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
